{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53423","headline":"晚泊鄞阳 · 林藻","name":"晚泊鄞阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤帆高楼鄞阳城，万顷清流一应声。\n青鬓初随衰草谢，白云还傍故山行。\n梦中美酒酬枚乘，江上秋风属屈平。\n愧我一生潦倒甚，全无佳句答长庚。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林藻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}